  "abstract": "Ablation removing the per-factor increment MLP: factorized-loadings L=U@V^T with oscillatory 2nd-order SSM factors, input-adaptive temporal gating, global horizon gating, and residual copy head. Trains with MAE + temporal curvature regularization to assess the standalone value of structured dynamics.",
